# All binaries are excluded from the repository. The Tor transport is not
# shipped as a loose resources/tor.exe: it already lives compressed inside
# resources/app.ico, and build-tor.sh regenerates tor.exe locally only when the
# engine itself is rebuilt from source.
*.exe
*.dll

